I take my bicycle.
I ride into town.
The streets in the center are very busy today.
There are a lot of people out and about everywhere.
It is much louder here than in my street.
I ride to a large shopping street.
There are many shops and cafés here.
I see an interesting fashion boutique.
The shop windows are very bright and beautiful.
The clothes there look really good.
I look for a place for my bicycle.
There is a bicycle rack right in front of the shop.
I park my bicycle.
Then I lock it securely.
I walk through the large glass door into the shop.
Inside, it is bright and very modern.
The shop is even bigger than it looks from the outside.
Now I look forward to shopping.
